  <p class="section-lead">
    Phase 20 runs 24V as the primary vehicle system (up from 12V, more headroom than Phase 19's 48V generator approach).
    Two alternators at 2,500W each driven by the 17.5:1 chain give 5,000W total at operating RPM.
    Boiler maintenance: ~1,000W. Vehicle accessories: ~500W. Net surplus: ~3,500W continuously charging the LiFePO4 battery pack.
    Cold start: 48V/100Ah LiFePO4 fires the flash boiler heater. System self-sustains by 200 RPM. Rhombic generator option noted for Phase 21 if more output needed.
  </p>

