  <p class="section-lead">Physics-based estimates updated for Phase 20 piston spec (75mm bore, 250mm stroke). Chevy Impala base weight ~1,650 kg. Estimated Phase 20 vehicle total ~1,990 kg (flash boiler saves ~36 kg vs Phase 19 drum boiler). Rolling resistance ~0.012. All figures require physical rolling road confirmation.</p>

